silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_yoneda_hom_leg_2_hasBodyMass silm:hasExample "In 'P1803_olog_node_arrow_lawYonedaHomLeg2', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, typed verb-arrow hasBodyMass: DomesticCat -> BodyMassQuality in the Mittens olog" .
